<title>USA: Summary says June 30 EPS of $0.03/shr.</title>
<headline>Summary says June 30 EPS of $0.03/shr.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON, Texas 1996-09-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Summary Corp Wednesday said it expects to have combined six month earnings of about $0.03 a share for the period ending June 30.</p>
<p>The Houston-based Internet provider company also said it was changing its name to LumaNet, effective immediately.</p>
<p>The company went public in August of 1995, said company spokesman Keith Cartwright, and acquired Azteq Systems Inc last month.</p>
